# Store and check out every text file with LF. Without this, a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) writes CRLF, and `npm pack` / `gem build` /
# `luarocks pack` run there ship CRLF shebang scripts and shell scripts that
# do not run on Linux or macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
